- ui_mask : scirpt to check on wheater to pick the portion of 50km or 200m isobath;

- mask_making_script: script to make masks 50, 150, 300km ;

- ccmp_offshore_masks: .mat file with 50,150,300 km masks structures;

- mask_plots : script to make plots of mask (ccmp_offshore_masks);

- maks_product : scirpt to masks data_products make masks 50, 150, 300 km;


